 \"summary\": \"The draft article successfully aligns with the ground truth confirming the release of the CBSE CTET 2026 Notification and Application Form on ctet.nic.in. The author smartly avoided hallucinating specific deadline dates by directing readers to the official website. Standard CTET parameters (eligibility, fees, and exam patterns) are accurate based on historical standards, but should be double-checked against the live 2026 bulletin.\"\n}\n}', '5248', '1', NULL, '2026-08-21 09:51:29');
