trict dress codes, and a highly synchronized reporting timetable designed to eliminate administrative delays. Aspirants are advised to thoroughly understand these regulatory updates to ensure a hassle-free examination day.</p><h2>Important Dates, Timetable & Official Deadlines</h2><p>To maintain administrative efficiency, the NTA has laid down a strict schedule for the pre-examination, examination-day, and post-examination phases. Candidates must strictly adhere to the designated timelines, particularly the afternoon gate closure times, as no entry will be permitted under any circumstances after the official cutoff time. Below is the detailed timetable compiled from the official NTA notification:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Official', '6387', '1', NULL, '2026-08-21 09:52:07');
