e across all centers\",\"Mandatory biometric verification before entry\"],\"dates_table\":[{\"event\":\"Reporting Time Closes\",\"date\":\"May 03, 2026 (01:30 PM)\",\"status\":\"confirmed\"},{\"event\":\"Examination Timing\",\"date\":\"02:00 PM to 05:20 PM\",\"status\":\"confirmed\"}],\"source_attribution\":{\"name\":\"National Testing Agency\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/exams.nta.ac.in\\/NEET\\/\",\"reference\":\"NTA\\/NEET-UG\\/2026\\/PUBLIC-NOTICE-01\"}}', '100', '1', NULL, '2026-08-21 12:41:40');
