d age criteria. Age relaxations are provided per Government of India norms:</p><ul><li><strong>SC/ST:</strong> 5 years</li><li><strong>OBC-NCL:</strong> 3 years</li><li><strong>PwD:</strong> Up to 10 years</li></ul><p>Educational requirements range from Matriculation (10th pass) for Level-1 posts to Graduate degrees for NTPC categories.</p><h2>Application Procedure</h2><ol><li>Visit your regional RRB website (e.g., rrbcdg.gov.in).</li><li>Navigate to the \'CEN\' section and select \'Apply Online\'.</li><li>Complete \'New Registration\' using a valid email and mobile number.</li><li>Log in with your credentials to fill in personal and educational details.</li><li>Upload required documents, photographs, and signatures.</li><li>Pay th', '2423', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:51:22');
