></tr></tbody></table><h2>Eligibility & Age Relaxation</h2><p>Candidates must meet specific educational and age criteria. Age relaxations are provided per Government of India norms:</p><ul><li><strong>SC/ST:</strong> 5 years</li><li><strong>OBC-NCL:</strong> 3 years</li><li><strong>PwD:</strong> Up to 10 years</li></ul><p>Educational requirements range from Matriculation (10th pass) for Level-1 posts to Graduate degrees for NTPC categories.</p><h2>Application Procedure</h2><ol><li>Visit your regional RRB website (e.g., rrbcdg.gov.in).</li><li>Navigate to the \'CEN\' section and select \'Apply Online\'.</li><li>Complete \'New Registration\' using a valid email and mobile number.</li><li>Log in with your credentials to fill in per', '3097', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:51:29');
INSERT INTO `ai_logs` (`id`, `article_id`, `trend_id`, `pipeline_stage`, `prompt_summary`, `response_summary`, `tokens_used`, `success`, `error_message`, `created_at`) VALUES ('1128', NULL, NULL, 'seo_generation', 'Please generate SEO metadata for this article:\n\nARTICLE TITLE: RRB Recruitment 2024: Official Notification, Eligibility & Exam Guide\nCATEGORY: exam-dates\nARTICLE CONTENT EXCERPT:\nOverview of RRB RecruitmentThe Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) conducts centralized recruitment for various technical, non-technical, and safety-related positions across Indian Railways. Aspirants should rely exclusively on official regional portals, such as rrbcdg.gov.in, for verified Centralized Employment Notificatio', '{\n  \"seo_title\": \"RRB Recruitment 2024: Official Notification & Exam Guide\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"Get the latest RRB Recruitment 2024 details. Check official notification, eligibility criteria, exam pattern, and application steps to apply online now.\",\n  \"slug_suggestion\": \"rrb-recruitment-2024-official-notification\",\n  \"excerpt\": \"Access the complete guide for RRB Recruitment 2024. Learn about eligibility, application steps, exam patterns, and official notification details here.\",\n  \"target_keywords\": [\n    \"RRB recruitment 2024\",\n    \"RRB official notification 2024\",\n    \"how to apply for RRB exams\",\n    \"RRB eligibility criteria\",\n    \"RRB exam pattern 2024\",\n    \"Railway recruitment board application\",\n    \"RRB CEN notification\"\n  ],\n  \"faqs\": [\n    {\n      \"question\": \"Can I submit multiple applications for different RRB posts?\",\n      \"answer\": \"No, submitting multiple applications for the same CEN is strictly prohibited and will lead to the automatic rejection of your candidature.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question\": \"What is the negative marking scheme for RRB CBT exams?\",\n      \"answer\": \"The RRB Computer Based Test follows a negative marking scheme where 1/3rd of a mark is deducted for every incorrect answer provided.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '1318', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:51:33');
