/\\\">CBSE Board Exams 2027: Class 10 and 12 LOC Registration</a> is equally critical for academic planning.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>OTR Registration</td><td>Open Year-Round</td></tr><tr><td>Scheme Applications</td><td>Per Ministry Notification</td></tr><tr><td>Aadhaar/Biometric Verification</td><td>Mandatory</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Step-by-Step OTR and Application Process</h2><ol><li><strong>Register:</strong> Visit <a href=\\\"https://scholarships.gov.in\\\">scholarships.gov.in</a>.</li><li><strong>Install App:</strong> Download the NSP OTR mobile app from the Google Play Store.</li><li><strong>e-KYC:</strong> Register using your Aadhaar number to complete the e-KYC proc', '2930', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:52:02');
INSERT INTO `ai_logs` (`id`, `article_id`, `trend_id`, `pipeline_stage`, `prompt_summary`, `response_summary`, `tokens_used`, `success`, `error_message`, `created_at`) VALUES ('1134', NULL, NULL, 'seo_generation', 'Please generate SEO metadata for this article:\n\nARTICLE TITLE: NSP One-Time Registration (OTR) Guide: Mandatory Steps for Students\nCATEGORY: exam-dates\nARTICLE CONTENT EXCERPT:\nOverview of NSP One-Time Registration (OTR)The Ministry of Education has introduced the One-Time Registration (OTR) process for the National Scholarship Portal (NSP). This mandatory step streamlines scholarship disbursements and prevents duplicate applications across Pre-Matric, Post-Matric, and Higher Education schemes. ', '{\n  \"seo_title\": \"NSP One-Time Registration 2025: Complete OTR Guide\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"Complete your NSP One-Time Registration (OTR) with our step-by-step guide. Learn about Aadhaar-based e-KYC, face authentication, and required documents.\",\n  \"slug_suggestion\": \"nsp-one-time-registration-otr-guide\",\n  \"excerpt\": \"Learn how to complete your mandatory NSP One-Time Registration (OTR) using Aadhaar-based face authentication. Follow our step-by-step guide to apply today.\",\n  \"target_keywords\": [\n    \"NSP OTR registration\",\n    \"National Scholarship Portal OTR\",\n    \"how to do NSP OTR\",\n    \"NSP OTR mobile app\",\n    \"NSP scholarship registration 2025\",\n    \"Aadhaar e-KYC for NSP\",\n    \"NSP OTR reference number\"\n  ],\n  \"faqs\": [\n    {\n      \"question\": \"Is OTR mandatory for all NSP scholarship applicants?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Yes, One-Time Registration (OTR) is now a mandatory foundational requirement for all students applying for central sector scholarships on the NSP portal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question\": \"What should I do if my face authentication fails in the NSP OTR app?\",\n      \"answer\": \"Ensure you are in a well-lit area, remove glasses or headgear, and check that your Aadhaar-linked mobile number is active to receive the necessary OTPs.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}', '1319', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:52:06');
