trong> Follows standard Government of India mandates for EWS, SC, ST, and OBC categories.</li></ul><h2>Application Process</h2><ol><li>Visit <strong>ssc.gov.in</strong>.</li><li>Complete One-Time Registration (OTR) using a valid government ID.</li><li>Log in to the CGL 2026 dashboard.</li><li>Enter personal and educational details accurately.</li><li>Upload photograph (20KB-50KB) and signature (10KB-20KB) in JPEG format.</li><li>Review details and submit the application fee via UPI, Net Banking, or Card.</li><li>Download and save the final submission receipt.</li></ol><h2>Exam Pattern & Marking Scheme</h2><p>The selection process evaluates Quantitative Aptitude, Reasoning, English, and General Awareness.</p><ul><li><strong>', '2245', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:53:13');
