idates must have cleared the preceding NTPC selection stages and hold a valid degree. Age relaxation applies as per Government of India norms: 5 years for SC/ST, 3 years for OBC-NCL, and up to 10 years for PwD candidates.</p><p><strong>Mandatory Vision Requirement:</strong> Candidates must provide a Vision Certificate signed by an Eye Specialist in the official RRB format.</p><h2>Application Procedure</h2><ol><li>Visit your regional RRB portal (e.g., rrbcdg.gov.in).</li><li>Select the active NTPC 2026 notification under the \'Recruitment\' tab.</li><li>Register using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li><li>Upload required educational certificates and category proofs.</li><li>Pay the examination fee via Net Banking, Credit/Deb', '2359', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:53:45');
