 year. No upper age limit.</li><li><strong>Reservation:</strong> SC (15%), ST (7.5%), OBC-NCL (27%), EWS (10%), and PwD (5% horizontal).</li></ul><h2>Application Process</h2><ol><li>Visit the official portal at <strong>exams.nta.ac.in/NEET</strong>.</li><li>Register with a valid mobile number and email to generate your Application Number.</li><li>Fill in all personal and academic details accurately.</li><li>Upload required documents, photographs, and signatures.</li><li>Pay the application fee via Credit/Debit Card, Net Banking, or UPI.</li><li>Download and print the confirmation page for your records.</li></ol><h2>Document Specifications</h2><ul><li><strong>Passport Photo:</strong> 10kb–200kb (JPG).</li><li><strong>Postcar', '2250', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:54:21');
