ions of society. The scholarship is not merely a financial aid program but a strategic intervention to foster inclusive growth in the Indian education sector.</p><h2>Important Dates, Timetable & Official Deadlines</h2><p>Candidates are advised to monitor the official NTA YET portal regularly. While the specific calendar for 2026 is subject to the official notification release, the following table outlines the standard operational timeline for the application and examination process.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Timeline</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Notification Release</td><td>To be announced</td><td>Pending</td></tr><tr><td>Online Application Window</td><td>To be announced</td><td>Pending</td></tr><tr><td', '2764', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 04:54:39');
