><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Reasoning</td><td>30</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td><strong>100</strong></td><td><strong>120</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Disclaimer: The pattern is based on historical data; refer to the official notification for final updates.</em></p><h2>High-Yield Topics for Preparation</h2><p>Focus your study plan on these frequently tested areas:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Subject</th><th>Key Topics</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mathematics</td><td>Number System, Percentages, Time & Work, Profit & Loss</td></tr><tr><td>Reasoning</td><td>Coding-Decoding, Syllogism, Data Interpretation, Series</td></tr><tr><td>General Awareness</td><td>Current Affairs, History, Geograp', '2046', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 05:43:48');
