h>Paper</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Day 1</td><td>Forenoon</td><td>Qualifying Paper: Indian Language</td></tr><tr><td>Day 1</td><td>Afternoon</td><td>Qualifying Paper: English</td></tr><tr><td>Day 2</td><td>Forenoon</td><td>Essay Paper</td></tr><tr><td>Day 3</td><td>Forenoon</td><td>General Studies I</td></tr><tr><td>Day 3</td><td>Afternoon</td><td>General Studies II</td></tr><tr><td>Day 4</td><td>Forenoon</td><td>General Studies III</td></tr><tr><td>Day 4</td><td>Afternoon</td><td>General Studies IV</td></tr><tr><td>Day 5</td><td>Forenoon</td><td>Optional Paper I</td></tr><tr><td>Day 5</td><td>Afternoon</td><td>Optional Paper II</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Trend-Based Historical Distribution of GS Papers</h2><p>While the UPSC does', '2555', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 05:44:15');
