ng Capacity</td><td>Must carry 35 kg for a distance of 100 meters in 2 minutes in one chance</td></tr><tr><td>Running Distance</td><td>Must run 1000 meters in 4 minutes and 15 seconds in one chance</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>PET Requirements for Female Candidates</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Weight Carrying Capacity</td><td>Must carry 20 kg for a distance of 100 meters in 2 minutes in one chance</td></tr><tr><td>Running Distance</td><td>Must run 1000 meters in 5 minutes and 40 seconds in one chance</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Selection Rules and Merit Calculation</h2><p>The selection process for RRB Group D 2026 is governed by the merit list generated from the CBT. The PET ', '2399', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 07:08:00');
