 standard IBPS exam pattern accurately. However, it makes definitive claims about the initiation of the \'CRP CLERKS-XVI\' recruitment cycle which cannot be verified against the provided ground truth. The content is high-quality but requires confirmation that the official notification has been published by IBPS to avoid premature reporting.\"\n}', '1794', '1', NULL, '2026-08-22 07:08:59');
